      "text": "PRACTICE TRACKS Prepare for behavioral and technical interviews Mockly focuses on the two interview areas that matter most: strong behavioral stories and clear technical communication. Behavioral Practice Storytelling, leadership, and decision making Use STAR structure to turn experiences into clear, high-signal answers. Practice ownership, conflict resolution, ambiguity, and impact framing. Improve communication quality with concise, outcome-driven responses. Technical Practice Coding depth and technical communication Train on system design, debugging, trade-offs, and performance reasoning. P",
